//   Type:      [Template | Document | Code | Data]
//   Component: [Ladder | Baton | Rails] — builds up | passes between | guides
//   Role:      [Responsibility in system]
//
// Key: B-void-planning-workflow-block-update
// Title: Block Update Workflow — Surgical File Editing
//
// Type: Document
// Component: Rails — guides file editing process
// Role: Defines how existing files are updated block by block — precision over wholesale rewrite
//
// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// # M.2 Lifecycle State [STATE]
//
//   Current status and version tracking.
//   Tracks when file was created, updated, and its maturity.
